msgid "缺陷"
msgstr "Defects"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/categories/defect-surface.md:3
#: 1c9e3a9f41b34cc6a6ea7abfdd5173ce
msgid ""
"与卡片 UI 的“缺陷”分组一致。这些卡片负责删位、插入原子、加入吸附原子或生成层错路径。 "
"自由表面的构造单独放在“表面”分组；表面缺陷通常先建表面，再接这里的局部操作。"
msgstr ""
"This section matches the `Defects` group in the card picker. These cards "
"remove sites, insert atoms, add adsorbates, or generate stacking-fault "
"paths. Free surfaces are created separately in the `Surfaces` group; to "
"create a surface defect, usually build the surface first and then apply "
"one of the local operations listed here."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/categories/defect-surface.md:15
#: f63efebe6dfb46448261c3b687207a2c
#
msgid "旧版 `旧版层错位移` 已从添加菜单隐藏，只用于历史 JSON 兼容。新任务统一使用 `层错路径`。"
msgstr ""
"The legacy `Stacking Fault` card is hidden from the Add menu and retained"
" only for historical JSON compatibility. Use `GSFE Path` for new "
"workflows."

#~ msgid "缺陷与表面"
#~ msgstr "Defects and surfaces"
